<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak c.bank reserves dip to $3.426 bln - Feb 19.</title>
<headline>Slovak c.bank reserves dip to $3.426 bln - Feb 19.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Slovakia (NBS) said on Monday its hard currency reserves dipped to $3.426 billion as of February 19, from $3.487 billion on February 12.</p>
<p> HARD CURRENCY RESERVES  Feb 19  Feb 12   Jan 29  Dec 31/96</p>
<p>  NBS reserves ($bln)    3.426   3.487    3.418    3.473</p>
<p>  Commercial banks	 1.857   1.920    1.920    2.321</p>
<p>  Entire banking sector  5.283   5.407    5.338    5.794</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 42-7-521-8402</p>
</text>
